From: pavel@PARK.bu.edu (Paul Cisek)
Date: Tue, 20 Sep 1994 19:38:59 -0400
Subject: [#94-9-326] Penrose's "Shadows of the Mind"

>From: doug@OpenMind.com (Doug Cutrell)
